<title>JAPAN: Japan rubber stocks rise at end of March.</title>
<headline>Japan rubber stocks rise at end of March.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>End-March rubber stock figures, issued by the Japan Rubber Trade Association on Monday, with month-earlier and year-earlier comparisons, in tonnes, were as follows:</p>
<p>    Month	    Mar 97   Feb 97   Mar 96</p>
<p>    Stocks	   43,875   41,311   42,112</p>
<p>Breakdown of stocks, in tonnes</p>
<p>    Crude rubber   39,027   35,426   35,529</p>
<p>    Synthetic	 4,689    5,701    6,525</p>
<p>    Latex		 159	184	 58</p>
</text>
